---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Perqed — Autonomous Mathematical Discovery & Verified Proving Engine"
  description="Autonomous theorem discovery system discovering novel mathematics and formally verifying proofs in Lean 4 with zero auxiliary axioms."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Autonomous Formal Discovery</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Discovering novel mathematics.<br>
        <span style="color: var(--accent);">Verified in pure Lean 4.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Perqed is an autonomous theorem discovery and interactive proof system. It formulates mathematical conjectures, applies analytical number theory and sieve methods, and compiles zero-axiom machine proofs verified by the Lean&nbsp;4 kernel.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#discoveries" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Discoveries ↓</a>
        <a href="/blog/" class="btn btn-ghost">Research Articles</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/bneb/perqed" class="btn btn-ghost" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key Discoveries -->
  <section class="section" id="discoveries">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Recent Mathematical Breakthroughs</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading">Verified Research Results</h2>
      <p class="section-lede">
        Bridging open problems in analytical number theory with zero-defect formal verification.
      </p>

      <div class="discoveries-grid">
        <div class="discovery-card">
          <div class="card-tag">Number Theory · Sieve Anatomy</div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Terence Tao's Erdős–Graham Factorial Problem</h3>
          <p class="card-source">Grounded in Terence Tao (<em>arXiv:2603.27990</em>, March 2026)</p>
          <p class="card-body">
            Resolved Tao's open conjecture on 3-factorial square products by isolating the dominant H=1 family and proving the exact leading asymptotic constant:
          </p>
          <div class="card-formula">
            <code>C₁ = ∑ 1 / √(s(a₁!)) = 4.26529314...</code>
          </div>
          <ul class="card-list">
            <li>Unconditional exponential tail decay: R(50) &lt; 10⁻⁶</li>
            <li>Sieve parity equidistribution & square collision rigidity</li>
            <li>8 locked Lean 4 declarations audited with 0 <code>sorryAx</code></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="discovery-card">
          <div class="card-tag">Diophantine Equations · Baker's Method</div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Generalized Cunningham Diophantine Resolution</h3>
          <p class="card-source">Generalized from Panda (2024)</p>
          <p class="card-body">
            Complete classification of pˣ + (2ᵏ p + 1)ʸ = z² for odd primes p and integer steps k ≥ 2:
          </p>
          <div class="card-formula">
            <code>pˣ + (2ᵏ p + 1)ʸ = z²</code>
          </div>
          <ul class="card-list">
            <li>Universal Mersenne & Affine solution families for (x=1, y=1)</li>
            <li>Complete Modulo 8 & Modulo 4 non-residue obstructions</li>
            <li>Baker–Davenport continued fraction reduction certifying global exhaustiveness</li>
            <li>11 locked Lean 4 declarations audited with 0 <code>sorryAx</code></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="discovery-card">
          <div class="card-tag">Topology · Graph Theory</div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Hamiltonian Torus Decompositions</h3>
          <p class="card-source">Zero-Sorry Prop-Valued Proofs</p>
          <p class="card-body">
            Proved exact edge-disjoint Hamiltonian decompositions on 3-dimensional tori for M=4 (64 vertices) and M=6 (216 vertices) using custom decidable universal quantifiers.
          </p>
          <ul class="card-list">
            <li>Zero <code>sorry</code>, fully decidable quantifier reflection</li>
            <li>Verified injection and non-short orbit closure</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Architecture -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Discovery Architecture</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading">How Perqed Works</h2>
      <p class="section-lede">
        Autonomous heuristic search coupled with cold-kernel formal verification.
      </p>

      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-n">01</span>
          <h3 class="step-title">Conjecture Formulation & Ingestion</h3>
          <p class="step-body">
            Ingests active open problems from recent literature (arXiv preprints), extracting theorem candidates, algebraic structures, and search parameters.
          </p>
          <span class="step-tech">arXiv Ingestion · AST Parser</span>
        </div>

        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-n">02</span>
          <h3 class="step-title">Mathematical Depth Evaluation</h3>
          <p class="step-body">
            Penalizes trivial Presburger identities (0.15×) and rewards deep sieve/analytical methods (3.5×), ensuring the system targets high-impact mathematics.
          </p>
          <span class="step-tech">MathematicalDepthEvaluator · MDL</span>
        </div>

        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-n">03</span>
          <h3 class="step-title">Analytical Trapping & Reductions</h3>
          <p class="step-body">
            Applies Baker's linear forms in logarithms and Baker–Davenport continued fraction reductions to collapse infinite exponent domains into finite testable bounds.
          </p>
          <span class="step-tech">LinearFormsLogarithmEngine · Laurent Bounds</span>
        </div>

        <div class="step">
          <span class="step-n">04</span>
          <h3 class="step-title">Zero-Axiom Lean 4 Proving</h3>
          <p class="step-body">
            Compiles candidate theorems into pure Lean 4 specifications and machine proofs, checked by the cold Lean 4 kernel with 0 <code>sorryAx</code> auxiliary axioms.
          </p>
          <span class="step-tech">Lean 4 · AuditSpec Reflection</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta">
    <div class="container" style="text-align: center;">
      <h2 class="cta-heading">Open Science & Reproducibility</h2>
      <p class="cta-body">
        All theorem specifications, machine proofs, and Python verification scripts are open source and cryptographically hash-locked.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="https://github.com/bneb/perqed" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View GitHub Repository ↗</a>
        <a href="/blog/" class="btn btn-ghost">Read Research Articles</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 96px 0 72px;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5.5vw, 3.8rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 580px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* Sections */
  .section {
    padding: 80px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .section-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .section-lede {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 540px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* Discoveries Grid */
  .discoveries-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 32px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .discovery-card {
    background: var(--bg-card, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03));
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .card-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .card-title {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .card-source {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .card-body {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .card-formula {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  .card-list {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-left: 20px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .card-list li {
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  /* Steps */
  .steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 48px 56px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .step-n {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .step-title {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .step-body {
    font-size: 0.93rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .step-tech {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .cta {
    padding: 80px 0 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .cta-heading {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .cta-body {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 460px;
    margin: 0 auto 32px;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero { padding: 56px 0 40px; }
    .section { padding: 48px 0; }
    .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
  }
</style>
